{
  "name": "SentrAI",
  "description": "SentrAI is an accountability-based security system for small organizations: it watches web, database and OS layers, turns anomalies into a 0-100 risk index, applies temporary reversible hotpatches when risk tolerance is crossed, and produces hash-chained evidence reports. The repo holds the project plan site (Jekyll) and a Python MVP (FastAPI core, Streamlit dashboard, Flask target lab, notifier). Note: this project has over 100 source files; consider scoping analysis to a subdirectory for faster results.",
